			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"派蒙"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 120220101,
					"content": "咦，心海还没来吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220102,
					"content": "好奇怪啊，总感觉心海不像是那种会迟到的人…我们再多等一会儿吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220103,
					"content": "心海怎么还没来，会不会是遇到什么麻烦了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220104,
					"content": "我们去找那边的士兵打听一下吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220701,
					"content": "你要见珊瑚宫大人？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柴田"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220702,
					"content": "不好意思，珊瑚宫大人不在这里，我也不知道她去了哪。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柴田"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220703,
					"content": "怎么这样…那我们只能回去了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220704,
					"content": "倒也不是。我记得珊瑚宫大人留下来的常备锦囊中，好像有应对这种情况的解决办法。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柴田"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220705,
					"content": "让我想想。第九十八条…<color=#00E1FFFF>「有客远来，寻我不见；可来南边，紫叶树前」</color>。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柴田"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220706,
					"content": "备注上还写了，只有珊瑚宫大人没有留下任何其他交代，且客人身份很特别时，才能适用这一条。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柴田"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220707,
					"content": "两位应该算远道而来的客人吧。这锦囊我一直带着，应该不会有错。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "柴田"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220708,
					"content": "心海果然什么情况都考虑到了，那我们到她说的地方找找看吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1202202,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1202208
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"1202208",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 1202208,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"珊瑚宫心海"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 120220204,
					"content": "心海！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220205,
					"content": "原来你在这里呀！不是说好今天一起去筹备庆功晚会吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220206,
					"content": "哦…是你们啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220207,
					"content": "抱歉，今天…有点不在状态。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220208,
					"content": "是生病了吗？我们马上去找医生...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220209,
					"content": "不是啦，只是我的「能量」暂时用完了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220210,
					"content": "能量…难，难道说心海，其实不是人类吗！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220211,
					"content": "不，只是一种比喻而已啦。虽然有些惭愧，但我没办法一直维持那种无所不能的样子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220212,
						120220213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220212,
					"content": "昨天被搭话的时候…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220214
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120220214,
					"content": "啊，你注意到了吗？看来我遮掩的功夫还不到家，还得继续锻炼才行…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220215,
					"content": "其实，我并不是很擅长做一个上位者。最早的时候，我的梦想就是读读兵书，做个幕僚之类的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220216,
					"content": "跟别人说话、照顾别人的情绪、察言观色、分配利益…在我看来是很麻烦的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220217,
					"content": "要让别人如沐春风，又要让他们有所敬畏，这不是我擅长的领域。不如说，这是我曾经不想涉足的领域。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220218,
					"content": "但是因为血脉的原因，「现人神巫女」的位置终究会传到我的手里。喜欢也好，不喜欢也罢，这是没办法的事情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220219,
					"content": "所以，当我感觉自己要扛不住了的时候，我就会到这里来。看看书，休息一会儿…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220220,
					"content": "不用担心，并不会影响工作。筹备庆功会的事情，我已经安排给其他人了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220221,
					"content": "今晚还有一场演讲，不能让士兵们看出有什么端倪…好不容易争取到了和平，我希望他们可以更加轻松自在一些。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220222,
					"content": "有什么我们能帮忙的吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220223,
					"content": "其实放着不管，我的能量也会慢慢恢复。但如果能听到我感兴趣的兵书，或许能更快地振作起来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220224,
					"content": "我记得上次有一本书看了一半，不知道放哪了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220225,
					"content": "就让我们来找一找吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220226,
					"content": "然后读给心海听，这样心海就能振作起来了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220227,
					"content": "真的吗？谢谢你们啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220228,
					"content": "呵呵…果然，你们回海祇岛真的太好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220213,
					"content": "确实感觉心海很苦恼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220214
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1202203,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1202217
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"1202217",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 1202217,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"派蒙"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 120220301,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}你看，这个会不会就是心海在找的兵书呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220302,
					"content": "今天剑鱼二番队的队长回来了，能量值+4——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220303,
					"content": "啊啊…那个是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120220304,
						120220305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120220304,
					"content": "我们什么也没看到。",
